---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Services — Griffith Creative | Custom Web Design & Development"
  description="Custom website design and development, scoped to your business. Ongoing care and enterprise partnerships available. Book a free call to get started."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 fade-in">
          Services
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          Everything you need.<br />
          Nothing you don't.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          Every engagement is scoped to your business, not a page count. Design, build, ongoing care, and enterprise partnerships. Book a call and we'll map out the right fit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Design & Build -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
            Core Offering
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
            Custom Design & Build
          </h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            One team designs, writes, and ships your site. We scope around your goals and your customers, whether that's a five-page presence or a full platform with integrations. You'll know the scope and the number before we start.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-block bg-accent text-dark font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors"
          >
            Get a Quote
          </a>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>Custom-designed pages, written and built for conversion</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>Mobile-responsive design</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>Search-ready foundations: semantic structure, metadata, schema</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>AI search optimization (ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>Contact forms, analytics, and conversion tracking</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>Custom integrations: booking, CRM, e-commerce</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>Fast, secure edge hosting</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-offwhite-muted">
            <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>
            <span>Revision rounds included in every scope</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Enterprise band -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="bg-dark-secondary border border-accent/30 rounded-lg p-10 md:p-14 fade-in">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-center">
          <div>
            <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
              Enterprise
            </p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
              Bigger than a project?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              High-traffic sites, legacy platform migrations, and ongoing partnerships with a dedicated team. If your website is infrastructure, not a brochure, we have a practice built for that.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/enterprise"
            class="inline-block w-full sm:w-auto justify-self-start bg-accent text-dark font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded text-center hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
          >
            Enterprise Partnerships
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Care Plan -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
            Optional Add-On
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
            Care Plan
          </h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mt-6">
            Your site launches complete. If you'd rather never think about it again, the Care Plan keeps it fast, current, and secure, with updates handled by the person who built it. Monthly, scoped to your site, cancel anytime. Book a call to learn more.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Updates & Changes</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">Content edits, new sections, and seasonal updates, handled within days, not weeks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Hosting & Monitoring</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">Managed hosting, uptime monitoring, and performance checks so the site stays fast.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Security & Backups</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">Dependency updates, SSL, and automatic backups. If something breaks, we fix it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-6 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold mb-2">Priority Support</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm">One point of contact. The same person who built your site answers the email.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Included in Every Project -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
          Included in every project.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg">
          No hidden fees. No add-on upsells. This is standard.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">100</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">PageSpeed Score</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">We target perfect Lighthouse scores on every build.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">SSL</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">Security</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">HTTPS everywhere. Secure headers. Production-ready from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">ADA</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">Accessibility</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">WCAG-informed design and semantic markup for inclusive access.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
          <div class="text-accent text-2xl font-bold mb-3">CDN</div>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-sm mb-2">Global Speed</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-xs">Edge-deployed on a global CDN for sub-second load times.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center fade-in">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
        Not sure what you need?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Book a free discovery call. We'll look at your current site, discuss your goals, and scope the right engagement. No pressure, no pitch deck.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-accent text-black font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors text-lg"
      >
        Book a Free Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
